response_template(i_would_treat_it_as_a_composition_self_chall, "I would treat it as a composition self-challenge, not self-management: pick three parts I already have and write ONE held-out dialogue, with fresh names so it cannot be memorized, that needs all three at once; it passes only if they cooperate with no new special-case module. I would ratchet it in English and Italian, bump my version, and journal whether composition held or a seam appeared. I can propose this; an external agent edits, runs the tests, and commits.").
