% gen504 (F.) — LA VECCHIA FRASE ERA DIVENTATA FALSA. Diceva «a fixed order and
% the first one that matches wins», e da quando esistono le politiche di condotta
% (mantra #17: `faculty_force`, cessione, retrocessione, guardie) l'ordine e
% un DEFAULT che la conoscenza puo' spostare. Una spiegazione di se' che descrive
% un motore che non c'e' piu' e' una falsa affermazione come le altre — la prima
% voce della scala di priorita' del §12 — e per giunta sul soggetto su cui
% parrot0 dovrebbe essere piu' affidabile.
response_template(i_try_my_modules_in_a_fixed_order_and_the_fi, "I offer the turn to my faculties one at a time and the first that claims it answers. The order is a default, not a law: the conduct policies I hold as knowledge can make a faculty yield the turn, demote it to a last resort, or hold it back behind a guard. Last turn {declined} each looked and declined, and nothing else claimed it, so I fell back to an honest «I don't understand.»").
response_template(no_module_matched_your_last_turn_so_i_fell_b, "No module matched your last turn, so I fell back to an honest «I don't understand.»").
response_template(i_try_my_modules_in_a_fixed_order_and_the_fi_2, "I offer the turn to my faculties one at a time and the first that claims it answers. The order is a default, not a law: the conduct policies I hold as knowledge can make a faculty yield the turn, demote it to a last resort, or hold it back behind a guard. Last turn {declined} looked first and declined; then '{trace_winner}' claimed it — so the faculties after '{trace_winner2}' were never consulted.").
response_template(i_try_my_modules_in_a_fixed_order_and_the_fi_3, "I offer the turn to my faculties one at a time and the first that claims it answers. The order is a default, not a law: the conduct policies I hold as knowledge can make a faculty yield the turn, demote it to a last resort, or hold it back behind a guard. Last turn '{trace_winner}' was the first to claim it, so the faculties after it were never consulted.").
